<title>USA: VISX submits more data on excimer laser.</title>
<headline>VISX submits more data on excimer laser.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif. 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>VISX Inc said Monday it has submitted a supplement to its pre-market approval application with the U.S. Food and Drug Administration for its Star excimer laser system.</p>
<p>VISX said it is requesting approval to treat mild to moderate, or 1.0D to 6.0D, of myopia with 0.75D to 4.50D of myopic astigmatism.</p>
<p>VISX shares were off 1/4 at 18-1/4 by mid-afternoon.</p>
</text>
